cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper.
title: >-
  documentation-era-retrieval-mimic: analysis code for local contrastive
  adaptation of a clinical retrieval encoder across documentation eras
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a complete within-unit 2x2 experiment measuring whether
  local contrastive adaptation of a dense retrieval encoder on one documentation
  era degrades retrieval of records written under another era, within a single
  institution (Beth Israel Deaconess Medical Center, via MIMIC-III and
  MIMIC-IV-Note). Includes the cross-corpus near-duplicate detector and its
  planted-duplicate control, the calendar-restriction verification, the preflight
  and post-run verification gates, the paired and patient-clustered bootstraps,
  the lexical baseline and the record-flux counter.
type: software
